␀Game boot - intent already consumed␀SD unavailable / missing WAD. Return CYM reboots.

Get official Freedoom Phase 1 v0.13.0:
https://github.com/JimGat/CYM-SD-Assets/tree/feature/doom-sd-assets/sdcard

Copy the contents of sdcard/ to the FAT32 SD root. Required: doom/doom1.wad (runtime /sdcard/doom/doom1.wad). License and credits accompany the separate SD assets.␀␀␀Game startup requires reboot isolation␀␀CONTINUE␀␀␀␀Insufficient memory for game surface␀␀␀␀Fire␀␀␀␀Use␀Cannot allocate game timer␀␀cym_doom␀␀␀␀Cannot allocate game worker␀I (%lu) %s: LAUNCH_REQUESTED path=%s
